From: Codex <codex@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] uxtheme: stretch and centre theme images like XP in the external shell

Purpose: match XP's pixels where a theme image is resized.
XP stretches theme images by repeating source pixels, and centres an image
glyph on the difference between its rectangle and the glyph. Wine used
HALFTONE smoothing, and centred each size separately, so an odd glyph in
an even rectangle sat one pixel lower. On the folder window's address bar
the drop-down button (16 pixels stretched to 18) and its arrow were both
off; with COLORONCOLOR and the XP centring, the button's pixels equal the
reference XP machine's. Glyphs whose sizes have the same parity, such as
the caption buttons, are placed as before. Only the opted-in external
shell is affected.

diff --git a/dlls/uxtheme/draw.c b/dlls/uxtheme/draw.c
index b50ab83..11b7126 100644
--- a/dlls/uxtheme/draw.c
+++ b/dlls/uxtheme/draw.c
@@ -394,7 +394,10 @@ static inline BOOL UXTHEME_StretchBlt(HDC hdcDst, int nXOriginDst, int nYOriginD
     int old_stretch_mode;
     POINT old_brush_org;
 
-    old_stretch_mode = SetStretchBltMode(hdcDst, HALFTONE);
+    /* XP stretches theme images by repeating source pixels; the opted-in
+     * external shell matches that instead of Wine's halftone smoothing. */
+    old_stretch_mode = SetStretchBltMode(hdcDst, GetEnvironmentVariableW(L"WIN4WINE_EXTERNAL_SHELL", NULL, 0)
+                                                 ? COLORONCOLOR : HALFTONE);
     SetBrushOrgEx(hdcDst, nXOriginDst, nYOriginDst, &old_brush_org);
 
     if (transparent == ALPHABLEND_BINARY) {
@@ -659,6 +662,13 @@ static HRESULT UXTHEME_DrawImageGlyph(HTHEME hTheme, HDC hdc, int iPartId,
     else if(halign == HA_RIGHT)  topleft.x += dstSize.x-srcSize.x;
     if(valign == VA_CENTER)      topleft.y += (dstSize.y/2)-(srcSize.y/2);
     else if(valign == VA_BOTTOM) topleft.y += dstSize.y-srcSize.y;
+    /* XP centres on the difference: an odd glyph in an even rectangle sits a
+     * pixel higher, as the ComboBox drop-down arrow does. */
+    if (pRect == &content)
+    {
+        if (halign == HA_CENTER) topleft.x = pRect->left + (dstSize.x - srcSize.x) / 2;
+        if (valign == VA_CENTER) topleft.y = pRect->top + (dstSize.y - srcSize.y) / 2;
+    }
 
     if(!UXTHEME_Blt(hdc, topleft.x, topleft.y, srcSize.x, srcSize.y,
                     hdcSrc, rcSrc.left, rcSrc.top,
